                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Research dataset supporting the publication “Samen Werken aan Sterke Wijken,” containing qualitative materials including policy documents (n=25), interviews (n=23), ripple effect mapping sessions (n=3), observations (n=113), and supporting research documentation across three municipalities. The objective was to explore which mechanisms promote or hinder cross-sector collaboration with citizen participation in priority neighborhoods."
                }
